#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 136 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 The object detects edges (transitions) in a stream of
numeric values: when the input changes from a low value to a high value
\, from a high value to a low value \, or both. On a detected edge
a bang is sent to the outlet. The behavior is controlled by the @mode
property: 'up' — only rising edges \, 'down' — only falling edges \,
'both' — both types.;
